2 CONT * Cao Daoheng 曹道衡 and Fu Gang 傅剛. Xiao Tong pingzhuan 蕭統評傳, 113–14. Nanjing: Nanjing daxue chubanshe, 2001. 
2 CONT * Xiong, Victor Cunrui. Emperor Yang of the Sui Dynasty: His Life, Times, and Legacy, 18–20, 71. Albany: State University of New York Press, 2006. 
2 CONT * Long, Laura. “Xiao, Empress of Emperor Yang of Sui.” In Biographical Dictionary of Chinese Women: Antiquity through Sui 1600 B.C.E.–618 C.E., eds. Lily Xiao Hong Lee and A.D. Stefanowska, 356–59. London: M.E. Sharpe, 2007.
2 CONT
