2 CONT [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=12366 '''Yang Xuan''' 楊暄] [12366] The #1 son of Jun [12365], who served in the administration of the Western Wei with its capital at Changan (as did Jun's younger brother Jian [1
