1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=25790 '''Wang Xia''' 王洽] [25790] The most famous of Dao(2)'s [25788] sons, he served in the administration of Jin Mudi and was the only direct ancestor of the Lan
2 CONC gya Wang(2) recorded in the XTS genealogical tables. I am assuming that he moved to the Eastern Jin capital since his descendants were dispersed in various places in China. Yan lu, 3.5b; Zhou Jiayou, 1.91. — [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
