2 CONT * Cao Daoheng and shen Yucheng, Zhonggu wenxue shiliao congkao, 321–22. 
2 CONT * Zhang Yibin 張義賓. “Zong Bing, Wang Wei meixue sixiang de benti yiyi” 宗炳、王微美學思想的本體意義. Dongnan daxue xuebao 7.5 (2005): 51–54.
2 CONT
