1 NAME Ruò /HUANG 黄若 97A/
2 GIVN Ruò
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄若 97A
1 NAME HUANG Ruo, 黄若 97A
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 533
1 DEAT
2 DATE 605
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 97th generation. 533 to 605. Only son of Duan Yi (端仪).
2 CONT
2 CONT Magistrate of Jingzhou (荆州刺史) during the Northern and Southern Dynasties (南北朝).
2 CONT
2 CONT Son-in law of Emperor Wu (陈武侯) of the Chen (陈) Kingdom. Had 6 sons - Fu Zhi (浮之), Tao Zhi (滔之), Lang Zhi (浪之), Liu Zhi (流之), Yuan Zhi (渊之) and Yuan Zhi (源之).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 九十七世。公元533 - 公元605。端仪之子, 滔之之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 南朝陈武侯时为荆州刺史, 后被武帝召为驸马。生六子 - 浮之, 滔之, 浪之, 流之, 渊之, 源之。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
