2 CONT * Ogasawara Senshū 小笠原宣秀. “Nan Sei Bukkyō to Shō Shiryō” 南齊佛教と蕭子良.  Shina Bukkyō shigaku 3.2 (1939): 63–76. 
2 CONT * Utsubi Masanobu 撫尾正信. “Nanchō shidaifu no Bukkyō shinju ni tsuite—Nan Sei Shō Shiryō to sono shūi” 南朝士大夫の佛教信受について: 南齊蕭子良とその 周圍. Saga Ryūkoku gakkai kiyō 5 (1957): 39–71. 
2 CONT * Wakatsuki Toshihiko 若摫俊秀. “Shō Shiryō no Bukkyō shinkō no seikaku” 蕭子良の佛教信仰の性格. In Chūgoku tetsugakushi no tenbō to mosaku 中國哲學史 展望摸索, ed. Kimura Eiichi hakushi shōju kinen jigyōkai 木村英一博士頌壽記念 事業會, 443–59. Tokyo: Sōbunsha, 1976.
2 CONC
2 CONT * Vande Walle, Willy. “Lay Buddhism among the Chinese Aristocracy during the Period of the Southern Dynasties: Hsiao Tzu-liang (460–494) and His Entourage.” Orientalia Lovaniensia Periodica 10 (1979): 275–97. 
2 CONT * Shiori Ryōdō 鹽入良道. “Bungen ō Shō Shiryō no Jōchuji-jōgyō-hōmon ni tsuite  文宣王蕭子良の淨住子淨行法門について.” Taishō daigaku kenkyū kiyō 46 (1986): 43–96. 
2 CONT * Chang Pei-pei 張蓓蓓. “Qi Jingling wang Xiao Ziliang ‘Xidi' wenshi jituan kaolüe” 齊竟陵王蕭子良「西邸」文士集團考略. In Mao Zishui xiansheng jiuwu shouqing lunwenji 毛子水先生九五壽慶論文集, 425–50. Taipei: Youshi wenhua shiye gongsi, 1987. 
2 CONT * Kuo Li-ying. Confession et contrition dans le bouddhisme chinois du ve au xe siècle, 111–12. Paris: Publications de l'École française d'Extrême Orient, 1995. 
2 CONT * Jansen, Thomas. Höfische Öffentlichkeit im frühmittelalterlichen China: Debatten im Salon des Prinze Xiao Ziliang. Freiburg im Breisgau: Rombach, 2000. 
2 CONT * Tang Chunsheng 唐春生. “Lun Xiao Ziliang zhi zhengzhi beiju” 論蕭子良之政治悲劇.  Xinan shifan daxue xuebao (Renwen shehui kexue ban) 27.2 (2001): 126–31. 
2 CONT * Wang Shuxian 王淑嫻. “Xiao Ziliang wenren jituan zhi zucheng ji qi zhengzhi yiyi shitan” 蕭子良文人集團之組成及其政治意義試探. Zhongzheng lishi xuekan 7 (2004): 3–24. 
2 CONT * Qi Lifeng 祁立峰. “Xiangsi yu chayi: lun Xiao Ziliang wenxue jituan tongti gongzuo de ‘shuxie xixing' yu ‘huwenxing'” 相似與差異：論蕭子良文學集團同題共作的  「書寫習性」與「互文性」 . Xingda Zhongwen xuebao 26 (2009): 1–25.
