2 CONC f the Xianbi Murong rulers of the kingdom of Yan (or Yan dynasty), which controlled most of Southern Manchuria, Hebei and Shandong for a period after the fall of the Western Jin. See Zhou Jiayou, 4.473. Jie was made Xiang (Chief M
