2 CONT * Chen Qing 陳慶. “Xie Zhuang shiwen xin tan—Wen xuan zuojia ge an yanjiu”  謝莊詩文新探— 《文選》作家個案研究. Wen xuan yu Wen xuan xue, 481–94.  Beijing: Xueyuan chubanshe, 2003. 
2 CONT * Cao Daoheng and Shen Yucheng, Zhonggu wenxue shiliao congkao, 318–21.
2 CONT *  Xu Mingying 徐明英 and Xiong Hongju 熊紅菊. “Xie Zhuang shige lühua chutan— jian yu Liu Yuejin xiansheng shangque” 謝莊詩歌律化初探—兼與劉躍進先生商榷. Changchun shifan xueyuan xuebao 23.1 (2004): 69–71. 
2 CONT * Zhong Qiurong 仲秋融. “Lun Yongming xiansheng Xie Zhuang de wenxue chuangzuo tese” 論永明先聲謝莊的文學創作特色. Qiusuo (2011: 11): 182–84.
2 CONT * Qu Xiaoyun 渠曉雲. Liuchao wenxue yu Yuedi wenhua 六朝文學與越地文化, 103– 9, 191–97. Beijing: Renmin chubanshe, 2010. 
2 CONT * Cutter, Robert Joe. “Threnodic Writings for Royal Women in Early Medieval China: Honored Consort Xuan of the Liu-Song.” Forthcoming.
